 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Not too bad.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.91,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I didn't get the job after the final round. Is it pushy to ask for feedback?",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.26,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Not pushy at all, and it often helps. A short, polite email is the way to go.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.04,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What do I say?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Thank them for their time, say you're disappointed but keen to improve, and ask if they'd share anything you could do differently.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "They probably won't reply.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.42,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Some won't, but plenty do. And it leaves a good impression if another role opens up.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.33,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait, what was the last part?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 3.44,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_05",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure, here it is again. Some won't, but plenty do. And it leaves a good impression if another role opens up.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.53,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I guess. I'm still",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.23,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "pretty gutted honestly.",
